# TypeScript System Rules

## 🎯 Core Alignment & Source of Truth
- **Follow `principles.md` as the absolute single source of truth for all TypeScript code generation and style rules.**
- If anything in this rule or file conflicts with `principles.md`, **`principles.md` wins**.
- If a rule conflicts with explicit project requirements, project requirements win.
- For specific implementations, consult the relevant rule files located inside `./.cursor/rules/{{SKILL_NAME}}/rules/`.
- Keep `CURSOR.md`, `.cursor/rules/hardwired-skill-typescript.mdc`, `CLAUDE.md`, and `rulebook.yaml` completely aligned with `principles.md`.
